A note on names of files in the release area:

If you look in the directory /mmi-cad/src/lgen (which points to the latest release),
you will see several types of files:

cp_mmig_*			: script to copy the latest version of this generator
				: into the release area.  can also be used if you want
				: to fetch only one generator not all.
generators*_utilities.tcl 	: utility routines used by many generators
MMIG_*.sue			: base level cells.  hand generated for mmi25, dpc pitch = 24um.
				: may need to be reworked for other technologies or pitches.
mmig_*.sue			: generators
mmig_*.doc			: documentation for top-level generators


===============================================================================================
The multiplier, mmig_mul, is by far the most complicated.  A full multiplier is made up of
trees of generators for various parts of the multiplier logic.  When you instantiate mmig_mul,
and select the options, it calls all the generators it needs to create the entire multiplier.

The multiplier uses global data structures to pass information between its zillions of
parts.  These global structures are set up in mmig_mul, so most of the sub-generators cannot
be instantiated on their own.

Don't worry, the global data structures do have uniquified names, so that different instantiations
of multipliers can be present in a single design.


Here are the generator trees for various combinations:

PPGAlgorithm=Simple, IncludePPG=0, IncludeCPA=0:

  mmig_mul -+- mmig_mul_array --- mmig_mul_slice


PPGAlgorithm=Simple, IncludePPG=1, IncludeCPA=0:

  mmig_mul -+- mmig_ppg --- mmig_ppg_slice --- mmig_ppg_4bit 
            |
            +- mmig_mul_array --- mmig_mul_slice


PPGAlgorithm=Simple, IncludePPG=0, IncludeCPA=0:

  mmig_mul -+- mmig_mul_array --- mmig_mul_slice
            |
            +- mmig_adder


PPGAlgorithm=Simple, IncludePPG=1, IntegratePPG=0, IncludeCPA=1:

  mmig_mul -+- mmig_ppg --- mmig_ppg_slice --- mmig_ppg_4bit 
            |
            +- mmig_mul_array --- mmig_mul_slice
            |
            +- mmig_adder


PPGAlgorithm=Simple, IncludePPG=1, IntegratePPG=1, IncludeCPA=1:

  mmig_mul -+- mmig_mul_array --- mmig_mul_ppg_slice --- mmig_ppg_4bit
            |
            +- mmig_adder


PPGAlgorithm=BoothRadix4 or BoothRadix8, IncludePPG=1, IncludeCPA=1:

  mmig_mul -+- mmig_ppg_booth
            |
            +- mmig_ppg -+- mmig_ppg_slice
            |            |
            |            +- mmig_nandbuf
            |
            +- mmig_mul_array --- mmig_mul_slice
            |
            +- mmig_adder
